WEBVTT

00:05.040 --> 00:06.080
<b>This is so cool!</b>

00:06.080 --> 00:07.000
<b>It looks great on you!</b>

00:07.000 --> 00:08.380
<b>It's got good stats, too!</b>

00:08.380 --> 00:10.580
<b>Haruka has a good side to him, huh?</b>

00:11.040 --> 00:14.710
<b>Offering away all these rare items he collected.</b>

00:15.330 --> 00:18.580
<b>I mean, sounds like he made off well from it.</b>

00:20.710 --> 00:22.290
<b>Business is booming!</b>

00:23.250 --> 00:25.580
<b>Haruka! Thanks for today!</b>

00:25.750 --> 00:27.670
<b>Everyone's so happy!</b>

00:27.830 --> 00:30.000
<b>That's great and all...</b>

00:30.330 --> 00:32.630
<b>Did you get the equipment you wanted?</b>

00:32.750 --> 00:34.170
<b>Yup! Sure did!</b>

00:35.210 --> 00:36.710
<b>Thank you, too, noble knight.</b>

00:38.790 --> 00:43.250
<b>Say, could you give us an actual introduction, now?</b>

00:43.750 --> 00:49.460
<b>Oh, well, her name is Angelica, and...
she's like... a dependable skeleton?</b>

00:49.750 --> 00:53.130
<b>And like, the dungeon's secret boss? Or emperor?</b>

00:53.380 --> 00:55.790
<b>I heard she was the Dungeon Emperor.</b>

00:56.040 --> 00:58.130
<b>Don't tell me you used the Pheromone Ring on her...</b>

00:58.790 --> 01:02.580
<b>Nope. I never found that ring.</b>

01:03.130 --> 01:04.790
<b>Then how?</b>

01:05.130 --> 01:06.130
<b>Well...</b>

01:07.080 --> 01:08.330
<b>"Well..."?</b>

01:10.670 --> 01:12.380
<b>With my Subjugate skill...</b>

01:12.710 --> 01:17.670
<b>Why?! Why did you subjugate the Dungeon Emperor?!</b>

01:17.670 --> 01:19.670
<b>D-d-don't ask me!</b>

01:24.460 --> 01:27.830
<b>Fine, if you won't tell me...</b>

01:28.960 --> 01:31.250
<b>Would you, Miss Dungeon Emperor?</b>

01:33.830 --> 01:35.920
<b>Great! Come with me!</b>

01:38.630 --> 01:41.080
<b>Is Angelica gonna be all right?</b>

01:44.670 --> 01:47.040
<b>I hope she can get along with everyone...</b>

01:49.710 --> 01:52.040
<b>[Good Luck lies in odd numbers]</b>

01:52.210 --> 01:53.130
<b>[Good Luck]</b>

02:04.580 --> 02:07.040
<b>Holed up in my room invincible on Monday</b>

02:04.580 --> 02:07.040
<b>Heya ni komoreba muteki sa Monday</b>

02:07.040 --> 02:09.500
<b>Take one step out and everything's a drag</b>

02:07.040 --> 02:09.500
<b>Ippo soto deriya mendou bakka</b>

02:09.630 --> 02:12.040
<b>They're drawn to a flame shouting mayday</b>

02:09.630 --> 02:12.040
<b>Tonde hi ni iru yatsura no mayday</b>

02:12.040 --> 02:14.130
<b>I wanna pretend I didn't hear them</b>

02:12.040 --> 02:14.130
<b>Kikanakatta koto ni shitai</b>

02:14.630 --> 02:15.960
<b>Give up on the fair fights</b>

02:14.630 --> 02:15.960
<b>Fair na shoubu wa yoshite</b>

02:16.750 --> 02:18.750
<b>First come first served is an illusion</b>

02:16.750 --> 02:18.750
<b>Hayamonogachi wa gensou</b>

02:19.290 --> 02:21.080
<b>Leave it all to the dice</b>

02:19.290 --> 02:21.080
<b>Saikoro ni azukechatte</b>

02:21.580 --> 02:24.210
<b>But make sure to roll them well</b>

02:21.580 --> 02:24.210
<b>Dakedo umaku korogashite</b>

02:24.630 --> 02:26.960
<b>Look, the stuff left behind after splitting things up</b>

02:24.630 --> 02:26.960
<b>Hora warikirenai amarimonotte</b>

02:26.960 --> 02:29.540
<b>Sometimes it's not all that bad y'know</b>

02:26.960 --> 02:29.540
<b>Angai suteta mon jyanai darotte</b>

02:29.540 --> 02:32.170
<b>The stuff they have and I don't</b>

02:29.540 --> 02:32.170
<b>Ano ko ni atte watashi ni nai monotte</b>

02:32.170 --> 02:35.380
<b>Nonsense, I won't be asking for it</b>

02:32.170 --> 02:35.380
<b>Nonsense hoshigattari wa shinai</b>

02:36.130 --> 02:39.210
<b>Alone & bad I'm doing great</b>

02:36.130 --> 02:39.210
<b>Hitoribocchi & BAD kimechatteru</b>

02:39.210 --> 02:41.880
<b>Wait now boy, you free?</b>

02:39.210 --> 02:41.880
<b>Soko no bocchan matte hima datte?</b>

02:41.960 --> 02:44.000
<b>Hate grouping up?</b>

02:41.960 --> 02:44.000
<b>Mureru no wa kirai kai?</b>

02:44.210 --> 02:47.130
<b>If you're bored, wanna try your luck?</b>

02:44.210 --> 02:47.130
<b>Taikutsu nara kakete minai kai?</b>

02:47.250 --> 02:49.670
<b>Botch & luck handle it and dance</b>

02:47.250 --> 02:49.670
<b>Botch & Luck norikonashite odore</b>

02:49.670 --> 02:52.250
<b>Down & fall is not my style</b>

02:49.670 --> 02:52.250
<b>Botsu & raku wa shumi jyanai</b>

02:52.420 --> 02:54.880
<b>Good Luck lies in odd numbers</b>

02:54.880 --> 02:57.420
<b>Isn't cheating a skill of its own?</b>

02:54.880 --> 02:57.420
<b>Zuru datte sainou mitai na?</b>

03:08.130 --> 03:10.630
<b>[Good Luck lies in odd numbers]</b>

03:10.710 --> 03:13.040
<b>[Good Luck lies in odd numbers]</b>

03:13.170 --> 03:15.630
<b>[Good Luck lies in odd numbers]</b>

03:15.710 --> 03:16.460
<b>[Good Luck]</b>

03:22.210 --> 03:25.880
<b>Loner & Loner</b>

03:25.080 --> 03:27.460
<b>Th-this is awkward...</b>

03:28.960 --> 03:32.130
<b>Question! If you're the emperor, are you a boy?</b>

03:33.710 --> 03:35.130
<b>What?! You're a girl?</b>

03:36.170 --> 03:37.790
<b>Same as us!</b>

03:38.170 --> 03:39.130
<b>How old are you?</b>

03:43.080 --> 03:44.170
<b>You're seventeen?!</b>

03:44.670 --> 03:47.250
<b>Same as us once again!</b>

03:47.460 --> 03:49.460
<b>That's great!</b>

03:49.630 --> 03:51.000
<b>And unexpected!</b>

03:51.130 --> 03:53.000
<b>I bet we'll get along!</b>

03:53.000 --> 03:54.500
<b>We'll have so much to talk about!</b>

03:59.500 --> 04:00.710
<b>Angelica...</b>

04:01.540 --> 04:04.750
<b>Can you tell us about yourself, bit by bit?</b>

04:06.540 --> 04:13.500
<b>She was trapped in darkness in the deepest level
of the dungeon until she was rescued by Haruka.</b>

04:14.920 --> 04:21.420
<b>Haruka didn't let her die,
breaking the curse with his Subjugate skill instead.</b>

04:20.460 --> 04:21.750
<b>SUBJUGATE</b>

04:23.130 --> 04:24.540
<b>We should help, too.</b>

04:27.630 --> 04:29.710
<b>By doing anything we can for her!</b>

04:31.290 --> 04:33.170
<b>This is the bath!</b>

04:34.920 --> 04:36.790
<b>Let's all hop in together!</b>

04:36.790 --> 04:38.250
<b>You're going to love it!</b>

04:38.250 --> 04:39.750
<b>The water's great!</b>

04:40.420 --> 04:44.540
<b>I hope this might warm up that cold, lonely heart of hers.</b>

04:46.380 --> 04:48.210
<b>Oh, sorry! Let me help.</b>

04:48.710 --> 04:53.250
<b>She might be a skeleton, but she's still a girl,
and must want to stay clean.</b>

04:54.380 --> 04:55.130
<b>What?!</b>

04:55.540 --> 04:56.920
<b>Why's she got a normal leg?</b>

04:57.380 --> 04:58.960
<b>Shouldn't she be bones?</b>

04:59.290 --> 05:01.540
<b>L-let's just take off the rest...</b>

05:18.080 --> 05:23.210
<b>I was pretty bummed I never found
the Pheromone Ring I was after.</b>

05:24.000 --> 05:27.880
<b>But I jumped up six levels at once
and a bunch of my skills powered up!</b>

05:28.540 --> 05:35.880
<b>MAGIC WARP</b>

05:28.540 --> 05:35.880
<b>DODGE</b>

