<b>TEMPERATURE</b>

05:28.550 --> 05:35.880
<b>WOODEN STAFF?</b>

05:28.550 --> 05:35.880
<b>PHYSICAL CONTROL</b>

05:28.550 --> 05:35.880
<b>LEATHER CLOTHING?</b>

05:28.550 --> 05:35.880
<b>NEET</b>

05:28.550 --> 05:35.880
<b>GAIT</b>

05:28.550 --> 05:35.880
<b>SHIFT</b>

