05:28.560 --> 05:35.880
<b>WEAPON SKILLS</b>

05:28.560 --> 05:35.880
<b>INSTANTANEOUS MAGIC</b>

05:28.560 --> 05:35.880
<b>TITLES</b>

05:28.560 --> 05:35.880
<b>TAKE OVER SKILLS</b>

05:28.560 --> 05:35.880
<b>STAFF MASTERY</b>

05:28.560 --> 05:35.880
<b>SHUT-IN</b>

05:28.560 --> 05:35.880
<b>WELL-BEING</b>

05:28.670 --> 05:31.000
<b>Learned a useful sounding Transfer skill, too.</b>

05:32.040 --> 05:34.250
<b>Can't make use of it yet, though.</b>

05:38.130 --> 05:44.000
<b>I could never have stopped that stampede
if it weren't for my classmates and Angelica.</b>

05:45.000 --> 05:47.960
<b>I've got to get stronger if I want to fight on my own.</b>

05:54.080 --> 05:55.830
<b>'Bout time I headed back to the woods.</b>

05:56.960 --> 05:59.960
<b>DAY 33</b>

06:00.210 --> 06:01.460
<b>Class Rep!</b>

06:05.500 --> 06:07.460
<b>Wh-what I saw yesterday...</b>

06:08.380 --> 06:12.170
<b>It seems like Haruka still doesn't know the truth.</b>

06:13.170 --> 06:17.540
<b>I've got some stuff I want to do.
I can head back to the woods, right?</b>

06:18.250 --> 06:22.250
<b>S-sure. As long as you come back.</b>

06:23.080 --> 06:26.000
<b>I'm sure there won't be another stampede for a while.</b>

06:26.500 --> 06:27.460
<b>All right!</b>

06:27.960 --> 06:30.500
<b>She seems to be getting along all right with the girls,</b>

06:30.790 --> 06:33.750
<b>but it wouldn't be right to leave her alone in town.</b>

06:35.000 --> 06:36.630
<b>Wanna come with me, Angelica?</b>

06:40.630 --> 06:41.330
<b>Huh?!</b>

06:41.330 --> 06:45.250
<b>Th-they're going back to the woods alone. Together?!</b>

06:45.880 --> 06:49.040
<b>Won't he find out Angelica's secret?!</b>

06:49.040 --> 06:51.130
<b>I'll see you later!</b>

06:54.880 --> 06:56.580
<b>H-hang on!</b>

06:57.920 --> 07:00.250
<b>Class Rep? What's up?</b>

07:00.880 --> 07:03.290
<b>I-I just...</b>

07:03.960 --> 07:07.500
<b>Wait, what am I worried about?</b>

07:12.500 --> 07:15.960
<b>I-it's nothing! Be nice to that girl!</b>

07:16.830 --> 07:18.960
<b>Dunno what you're talking about...</b>

07:22.000 --> 07:23.250
<b>But sure!</b>

07:29.920 --> 07:32.210
<b>This is how it should be, right?</b>

07:42.250 --> 07:43.920
<b>I've been out of the woods for too long.</b>

07:44.040 --> 07:45.580
<b>Love that sunlight through the trees.</b>

07:46.330 --> 07:48.630
<b>It's the perfect place to practice my Shift skill!</b>

07:49.920 --> 07:52.290
<b>Time to make way for my lovely home!</b>

07:52.290 --> 07:54.210
<b>Angelica, try and keep up.</b>

07:55.040 --> 07:55.710
<b>SHIFT</b>

07:57.000 --> 07:58.080
<b>Wow!</b>

07:58.630 --> 08:00.130
<b>This is working great!</b>

08:00.130 --> 08:02.250
<b>I bet I can get the hang of this!</b>

08:11.710 --> 08:13.080
<b>Maybe not quite yet.</b>

08:13.250 --> 08:15.670
<b>Getting pretty used to falling, though...</b>

08:17.040 --> 08:19.210
<b>Look out! Those mushrooms are slippery!</b>

08:28.500 --> 08:30.210
<b>See? Told you so.</b>

08:31.500 --> 08:33.920
<b>You're pretty heavy for a skeleton.</b>

08:49.630 --> 08:53.790
<b>Nothing can ever match a bath at home!</b>

08:53.790 --> 08:56.460
<b>This wind magic jet bath is amazing.</b>

08:56.960 --> 09:00.080
<b>Hey, Angelica, wanna join me?</b>

09:00.080 --> 09:01.290
<b>Just kidding!</b>

09:07.500 --> 09:10.420
<b>You might be a skeleton,
but you're still a girl, so we can't.</b>

09:10.710 --> 09:12.630
<b>Sorry for joking about it.</b>

09:15.710 --> 09:17.830
<b>Wh-wh-what the?!</b>

09:18.420 --> 09:21.170
<b>Why's a pretty blond girl here?!</b>

09:21.750 --> 09:22.920
<b>And why's she...</b>

09:25.540 --> 09:26.630
<b>...NAKED?!</b>

09:28.540 --> 09:31.830
<b>A-a-and where'd the Armored Rep go?!</b>

09:33.250 --> 09:36.000
<b>Wait, are you Angelica?</b>

09:46.250 --> 09:49.170
<b>M-maybe we should talk.</b>

09:52.420 --> 09:57.420
<b>She's really shy. It's even making me nervous!</b>

09:58.330 --> 10:01.670
<b>So, can you talk?</b>

10:06.210 --> 10:10.420
<b>Apparently she was a skeleton for so long,
she can't really find her voice.</b>

10:11.630 --> 10:17.170
<b>Through hand gestures and such,
she explained how she wound up this way.</b>

10:18.750 --> 10:25.460
<b>With the life gone from it, the Dungeon Emperor
was a skeleton monster that moved through spirit alone.</b>

10:26.420 --> 10:33.170
<b>But the silver armor restored her flesh
in order to activate its curse.</b>

10:35.500 --> 10:36.790
<b>Silver Armor</b>

10:35.500 --> 10:36.790
<b>CURSED</b>

10:35.500 --> 10:36.790
<b>FUSES TO FLESH AND BLOOD</b>

10:35.630 --> 10:41.580
<b>Then the Blessed Bangle's effects
negated the curse that left her stuck in the armor.</b>

10:36.790 --> 10:37.790
<b>FLOOR 77</b>

10:39.920 --> 10:42.920
<b>Blessed Bangle</b>

10:39.920 --> 10:42.920
<b>(Blessing) Sublimates disaster</b>

10:39.920 --> 10:42.920
<b>[Only once while equipped]</b>

10:43.040 --> 10:44.750
<b>NECROMANCER</b>

10:43.380 --> 10:47.580
<b>Then, with the Necromancy Jewel
that commands life and death,</b>

10:47.580 --> 10:48.420
<b>Necromancy Jewel</b>

10:47.580 --> 10:48.420
<b>Grants control over the dead</b>

10:48.420 --> 10:50.170
<b>FLOOR 79</b>

10:48.580 --> 10:50.630
<b>and the luck from the Ring of Boundless Fortune,</b>

10:50.170 --> 10:51.420
<b>Ring of Boundless Fortune</b>

10:50.170 --> 10:51.420
<b>Grants happiness and repels misfortune</b>

10:50.170 --> 10:51.420
<b>Greatly boosts LuK</b>

10:50.750 --> 10:53.000
<b>she even got back the lifeforce she'd lost.</b>

10:54.290 --> 10:56.540
<b>That's apparently how she came back to life.</b>

11:05.040 --> 11:07.710
<b>So basically... I did all this!</b>

11:08.290 --> 11:11.750
<b>Have you been helping me to say thanks?</b>

11:13.000 --> 11:18.130
<b>I might be robbing her of her freedom like this, though.</b>

11:18.790 --> 11:19.670
<b>In that case...</b>

11:21.130 --> 11:27.540
<b>Angelica, you're not a monster anymore,
so why not do what you want?</b>

11:28.960 --> 11:32.500
<b>You don't need to stick around with me.</b>

11:33.750 --> 11:35.210
<b>You're free, now.</b>

11:38.330 --> 11:39.040
<b>But...</b>

11:49.580 --> 11:54.960
<b>I see... She's been alone for so long,
she wants to be with someone now.</b>

11:57.080 --> 12:00.710
<b>I guess we can stay like this a while longer.</b>

12:02.250 --> 12:03.880
<b>Or better yet!</b>

12:07.670 --> 12:08.460
<b>Hey.</b>

12:09.210 --> 12:10.880
<b>I want to see her smile.</b>

12:11.540 --> 12:14.330
<b>Wanna hear a fun story?</b>

12:18.710 --> 12:22.540
<b>All right! Get ready, 'cause you're in for a long one!</b>

12:25.670 --> 12:30.420
<b>I kept talking until she fell asleep.</b>

12:25.670 --> 12:27.000
<b>Truth is, I-</b>

12:28.540 --> 12:30.420
<b>And then it was like-</b>

12:34.580 --> 12:38.960
<b>Telling her tales of another loner besides herself.</b>

12:45.040 --> 12:51.540
<b>DAY 43</b>

12:46.960 --> 12:49.630
<b>Angelica! Got a minute?</b>

12:51.750 --> 12:53.580
<b>Mind sparring with me?</b>

12:54.420 --> 12:56.000
<b>And I mean with all you've got.</b>

12:58.880 --> 13:02.500
<b>There's this skill I'm working on, see?</b>

13:02.960 --> 13:07.250
<b>I wanna see how much I've improved the last few days.</b>

13:15.830 --> 13:19.580
<b>Angelica is free from the darkness of the dungeon.</b>

13:20.380 --> 13:21.170
<b>MAGIC WRAP</b>

13:20.790 --> 13:24.420
<b>She's bound to be levels faster than when we last fought.</b>

13:25.290 --> 13:28.630
<b>But I'll surpass that speed with my Shift skill!</b>

13:33.880 --> 13:34.500
<b>Here she comes!</b>

13:35.580 --> 13:36.290
