<b>WALKING</b>

13:53.800 --> 13:54.790
<b>SORCERY</b>

13:53.800 --> 13:54.790
<b>CALISTHENICS</b>

13:53.800 --> 13:54.790
<b>SENSITIVITY</b>

13:53.800 --> 13:54.790
<b>HEIGHTENED INTUITION</b>

13:53.800 --> 13:54.790
<b>SWORDSMANSHIP</b>

13:54.790 --> 13:55.670
<b>TITLES</b>

13:54.790 --> 13:55.670
<b>FIEND SLAYER</b>

13:54.790 --> 13:55.670
<b>SAINT</b>

13:54.790 --> 13:55.670
<b> NEET</b>

13:54.790 --> 13:55.670
<b>SHUT-IN</b>

13:54.800 --> 13:55.670
<b>ILLUSIONIST</b>

13:54.800 --> 13:55.670
<b>TACTICIAN</b>

13:54.800 --> 13:55.670
<b>GUARDIAN</b>

13:54.830 --> 13:55.500
<b>But still...</b>

13:56.420 --> 13:58.040
<b>I AM going to get stronger!</b>

14:12.380 --> 14:15.040
<b>Dang it! No luck, huh?</b>

14:16.170 --> 14:19.130
<b>But I'm really getting the hang of Shift.</b>

14:21.080 --> 14:24.540
<b>You just watch. Someday I'll be stronger than you!</b>

14:28.250 --> 14:30.130
<b>All that exercise works up the appetite, huh?</b>

14:30.540 --> 14:32.000
<b>Let's go get something!</b>

14:39.460 --> 14:40.960
<b>Now that's a catch!</b>

14:41.790 --> 14:45.920
<b>I'm starting to get sick of just grilling them,
so how about a hot pot?</b>

14:47.250 --> 14:50.080
<b>Never had hot pot before, huh?</b>

14:50.420 --> 14:53.080
<b>It's super good though, just wait!</b>

15:05.830 --> 15:07.630
<b>It's easier if you hold the knife like this...</b>

15:08.330 --> 15:10.380
<b>...and use it like this.</b>

15:13.000 --> 15:16.750
<b>There you go. You've got a knack for cooking.</b>

15:24.630 --> 15:26.500
<b>This looks better than I expected!</b>

15:27.580 --> 15:29.040
<b>No point in waiting!</b>

15:30.380 --> 15:32.000
<b>Let's eat!</b>

15:36.710 --> 15:39.920
<b>Never thought I'd have hot pot in an isekai!</b>

15:40.960 --> 15:42.710
<b>I'm stuffed and chuffed!</b>

15:43.960 --> 15:45.330
<b>Hmm? What's up?</b>

15:49.250 --> 15:50.960
<b>Wh-where are we going?</b>

15:54.630 --> 15:56.540
<b>You telling me to sit down?</b>

15:58.000 --> 15:58.830
<b>Okay...</b>

16:12.580 --> 16:15.170
<b>I-is this...?!</b>

16:15.920 --> 16:17.000
<b>A massage?</b>

16:19.420 --> 16:22.580
<b>To like, say thanks and stuff?</b>

16:25.290 --> 16:27.460
<b>I don't see why not, then.</b>

16:33.540 --> 16:37.420
<b>Wow, Angelica. That feels really...</b>

16:37.830 --> 16:39.000
<b>...terrible!</b>

16:42.210 --> 16:45.460
<b>She's got a knack for missing all the right spots!</b>

16:46.040 --> 16:48.960
<b>Best keep that to myself, though...</b>

16:50.920 --> 16:55.710
<b>Oh, thanks... Feels so much better...</b>

16:56.540 --> 16:57.170
<b>Huh?</b>

16:58.420 --> 17:00.710
<b>You wanna know what else you can do?</b>

17:02.580 --> 17:04.540
<b>Hmm, right...</b>

17:05.130 --> 17:07.500
<b>Mind coming with me, then?</b>

17:13.880 --> 17:16.630
<b>Man, this really is something.</b>

17:16.830 --> 17:19.580
<b>You can come a little closer.</b>

17:20.880 --> 17:23.920
<b>She doesn't know anything but battle.</b>

17:26.290 --> 17:28.130
<b>Thanks for today.</b>

17:48.250 --> 17:50.710
<b>Don't worry. I understand.</b>

17:53.710 --> 17:57.880
<b>She's doing her best to make progress.</b>

17:59.380 --> 18:02.170
<b>Might be time to make her first big step.</b>

18:04.210 --> 18:05.210
<b>Angelica...</b>

18:06.000 --> 18:08.670
<b>Why don't we head back into town tomorrow?</b>

18:11.630 --> 18:14.500
<b>No need to worry. I'll be with you.</b>

18:26.000 --> 18:32.000
<b>DAY 44</b>

18:35.670 --> 18:37.960
<b>Uh oh, passing shower?</b>

18:44.170 --> 18:44.920
<b>Let's hurry!</b>

19:15.960 --> 19:17.750
<b>Hmm? Isn't that...?</b>

19:17.750 --> 19:19.130
<b>Angelica?</b>

19:19.130 --> 19:20.330
<b>It is!</b>

19:20.330 --> 19:21.460
<b>She's back!</b>

19:21.460 --> 19:22.670
<b>Long time no see!</b>

19:24.000 --> 19:26.960
<b>We're back, I guess?</b>

19:31.250 --> 19:33.000
<b>Wait, wh-wh-what now?!</b>

19:33.080 --> 19:37.040
<b>Wow, look at you two all over each other.</b>

19:44.380 --> 19:45.630
<b>It's been a while!</b>

19:45.630 --> 19:48.710
<b>Just got back from the dungeon ourselves!</b>

19:49.330 --> 19:50.830
<b>Tell us what you've been up to!</b>

19:50.830 --> 19:52.920
<b>Time for some emergency girl talk!</b>

19:56.670 --> 19:59.250
<b>Welcome back, Angelica.</b>

20:00.880 --> 20:04.670
<b>Thanks, Class Rep.
Gonna be counting on you from now on.</b>

20:07.040 --> 20:07.710
<b>Sure.</b>

20:08.630 --> 20:14.540
<b>Haruka! Out on a hand-holding date with a babe?
And you call yourself a loner!</b>

20:14.630 --> 20:17.710
<b>What's going on between you and Angelica?</b>

20:17.710 --> 20:19.670
<b>Shut up and leave me alone!</b>

20:19.670 --> 20:20.920
<b>Haruka's mad!</b>

20:24.330 --> 20:24.920
<b>Hmm?</b>

20:31.170 --> 20:34.380
<b>What's wrong? Go on and chat more with everyone.</b>

20:39.170 --> 20:41.290
<b>Don't worry about me.</b>

20:42.170 --> 20:44.290
<b>I'm gonna go for a stroll.</b>

20:47.790 --> 20:48.710
<b>Wait...</b>

20:56.460 --> 20:57.210
<b>Th...</b>

21:01.580 --> 21:03.960
<b>Th-thank... you...</b>

21:07.630 --> 21:09.960
<b>Read you loud and clear.</b>

21:14.920 --> 21:16.290
<b>Angelica!</b>

21:16.290 --> 21:17.630
<b>Tell us about your time in the woods!</b>

21:17.630 --> 21:19.540
<b>Let's take a bath together!</b>

21:17.630 --> 21:19.540
<b>I'm happy for you, Angelica.</b>

21:21.210 --> 21:23.880
<b>There's one thing I've learned in this isekai.</b>

21:24.920 --> 21:28.210
<b>Everyone's got their own troubles,</b>

21:28.830 --> 21:30.000
<b>anxieties,</b>

21:30.380 --> 21:31.960
<b>and secrets.</b>

21:32.790 --> 21:38.920
<b>Everyone feels cramped, trapped,
and uncomfortable around people.</b>

21:39.210 --> 21:41.960
<b>But deep down they're also lonely.</b>

21:43.000 --> 21:47.080
<b>I guess that means everyone's a loner in some way.</b>

21:49.080 --> 21:51.710
<b>But that doesn't mean they're on their own.</b>

21:58.540 --> 22:01.000
<b>And that's why I'm...</b>

22:02.170 --> 22:06.670
<b>...going to keep mastering this world alone!</b>

22:18.790 --> 22:23.130
<b>The sunset I saw alone was beautiful</b>

22:18.790 --> 22:23.130
<b>Hitori miteta yuuyake ga kirei da</b>

22:23.250 --> 22:28.580
<b>Without telling anyone about it at all it's time for bed again</b>

22:23.250 --> 22:28.580
<b>Sore o katariau koto mo naku kyou mo oyasumi</b>

22:28.580 --> 22:32.830
<b>Going on not worried about loneliness</b>

22:28.580 --> 22:32.830
<b>Sabishisa nante ki ni kakezuni susunde</b>

22:32.830 --> 22:38.420
<b>Encountering one new something after the next</b>

22:32.830 --> 22:38.420
<b>Tsugi kara tsugi e to deau atarashii nanika</b>

22:38.420 --> 22:45.170
<b>Been through a lot but it's unimaginable, isn't that funny?</b>

22:38.420 --> 22:45.170
<b>Sanzan na me ni atte demo souzou mo dekinakute waracchau yo na</b>

22:45.710 --> 22:50.170
<b>Might look indifferent but that's not always the case</b>

22:45.710 --> 22:50.170
<b>Dandan to mietetatte demo sonna bakkari jyanaitte</b>

22:50.290 --> 22:54.790
<b>Never learning, carefree and doing as I please</b>

22:50.290 --> 22:54.790
<b>Mada korizu ni iru kimama na jibun moteasonde</b>

22:55.170 --> 22:59.790
<b>That's always the way it is, we're all our lone selves</b>

22:55.170 --> 22:59.790
<b>Itsudatte sousa bokura wa hitori doushi</b>

22:59.920 --> 23:04.580
<b>As we pass by we trade hellos and goodbyes</b>

22:59.920 --> 23:04.580
<b>Surechigau tabi kawasu hello to goodbye</b>

23:04.960 --> 23:09.630
<b>Doesn't matter, just wanna enjoy today</b>

23:04.960 --> 23:09.630
<b>Dou datte ii sa kyou o tada asobitai</b>

23:09.630 --> 23:14.460
<b>Have a bit of fun and then it's goodnight</b>

23:09.630 --> 23:14.460
<b>Sasayaka ni tanoshinde sore de goodnight</b>

23:14.960 --> 23:19.670
<b>Sha-na-na-na-na, sha-na-na-na-na humming a tune</b>

23:14.960 --> 23:19.670
<b>Shanananana shanananana kuchizusandeiru</b>

23:19.830 --> 23:23.880
<b>Thinking about the day I see you again</b>

23:19.830 --> 23:23.880
<b>Kimi to mata au hi o omou</b>

23:24.790 --> 23:29.540
<b>Sha-na-na-na-na, sha-na-na-na-na humming a tune</b>

23:24.790 --> 23:29.540
<b>Shanananana shanananana kuchizusandeiru</b>

23:29.670 --> 23:33.460
<b>In the middle of my journey alone</b>

23:29.670 --> 23:33.460
<b>Hitorikiri tabi no tochuu</b>
